  <item>
    <title>猎罪图鉴2（上）：好亦坏时坏亦好，饭圈家暴APD</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6772956b15a5fd520ec3202b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6772956b15a5fd520ec3202b</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 30 Dec 2024 14:40:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>继雷队案告一段落之后，沈翊又出现了新的心结。某天他在杜城的车上看到眼前走过一对诡异的父女，直觉告诉他有问题，但他没有抓住这种感觉。第二天这个7岁的红裙小女孩死在了一个院子里，后悔和过度自责带来的压力让沈翊梦里的小红裙挥之不去。从那一天开始，他下定决心要用自己手中的画笔画出罪犯的心，救下受害者……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【节目预告】后五个案子的讲解将于不久之后上线，敬请期待！</span></p><span></span><p><span>P.s. 本期内容的主要观点大多来自于科迪本人的疯狂共情，不具有指导意义。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="201">03:21</a> 一、Idol之死案：爱不会让人举起屠刀</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a>当自卑的“招娣”遇上黯淡的“童星”……（袁招娣、陈勤）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a>偶像的服务、粉丝的需求</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1345">22:25</a> 二、盲童失踪案：野孩子？坏孩子？</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a>“受害者”的家暴倾向（刘强）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1630">27:10</a>如果你要做展翅高飞的鹏，我便是你身后坚实的磊。（小鹏、云磊）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2072">34:32</a> 三、自杀山谷审判案：善恶由我主宰</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2137">35:37</a>平坦的左边vs陡峭的右边（常枫）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a>“消失的她”（柯灵）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2800">46:40</a>你是失踪了，还是重生了？（小静）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">47:59</a> 四、“达芬奇”诱导自杀案：绝望泥潭中爬出来的“神”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3141">52:21</a>我不是家庭煮夫，我是创造怪物的神。（程以南）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3468">57:48</a> 五、海速网吧纵火案：“小白花”心中的“地狱之门”</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3518">58:38</a>失独家庭的哀歌（王浩、宋敏杰）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3702">61:42</a>你身边有反社会型人格障碍（APD）吗？（阮芳芳）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4244">70:44</a>预防未成年犯罪（再犯罪）应该从哪里抓起？</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4499">74:59</a> 六、恐怖婚礼案：“莉莉丝”一定会害人吗？</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4527">75:27</a>“时间管理大师”需要具备哪些“素质”？（罗一帆）</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4677">77:57</a>“毒舌恶女”是怎样炼成的？（奥莉）</span></li><span></span></ul>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/likr0UM10FpNxG9_PttbNQypW6E4.m4a" length="121727727" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:22:52</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsyh6JkgskKw5nLxIBSrvcFPG-1T.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
