  <item>
    <title>《猎罪图鉴1》全案件深度复盘：画像师笔下的人心与真相</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6755858c17cd5416ad65ffb3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6755858c17cd5416ad65ffb3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 08 Dec 2024 11:50:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>故事发生在2021年的北江市，在北江分局的刑警队长杜城和天才画像师沈翊的通力合作下，众人破获了一桩桩刑事案件。随着新的罪恶出现，7年前的旧案重新回到了大家的视野中。当年的真相逐渐浮出水面，甚至牵扯出了一起可能危害到全市800万人的大型犯罪案件……</span></p><span></span><p><span>【下期预告】带刷檀健次微博上的200道《猎罪1》复习题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="54">00:00:54</a> 《猎罪图鉴》基本介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">00:08:05</a> 主角故事背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="775">00:12:55</a> 第一案：整形医院毒杀案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">00:24:34</a> 第二案：北江七中操场埋尸案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2702">00:45:02</a> 第三案：骗婚杀人案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2889">00:48:09</a> 第四案：绑架案&amp;冒名顶替案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3636">01:00:36</a> 第五案：珠宝店持枪抢劫案（主线相关）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4489">01:14:49</a> 第六案：家暴男被反杀案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5048">01:24:08</a> 第七案：女大学生被强暴案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5366">01:29:26</a> 第八案：AI诈骗老人案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5940">01:39:00</a> 第九案：模特照片裁剪案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6106">01:41:46</a> 第十案：连环爆炸复仇案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6177">01:42:57</a> 终极大案：人口贩卖&amp;网络安全案</span></p><span></span><p><span>【瞿蓝心眼中的晓玄】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtyboddubgHRU1pxYuhdGJhsuyxN.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【”你画我画的可真像“】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Frfb9Q6gB3fS2JfceLfV-8lDOWg9.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【放它自由】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiViea7533FXvvAgqd8NmlkFXACs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【雷浩心目中的萧珊】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtPf_6_RTk2FNgvdTsSdr_L9SN6u.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【Close2u】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FucHnTurdoGo_aLD4qoPr2qskmjw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【猎罪天团】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuR9zPM5uiPOxZF7CpMS8YIQTN4J.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【告别&amp;新生】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiRy7P771v8YWKEay4tJK3NZkd2N.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【第二季伏笔】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lngtyHri_dACTHYhl3kT3LTGLFoN.png"></figure>]]></description>
