  <item>
    <title>《永夜星河》Part2：从妙声CP到禹宙中欣，磕学社会心理学</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674593eb8d1233fb0d30fcbc</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674593eb8d1233fb0d30fcbc</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 Nov 2024 09:40:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一、妙妙X慕声：谢谢导演，原来心动是可以拍出来的</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 矛盾人设：纯恨夫妻、少年夫妻、双向治愈</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a>硬件：摄影、打光、妆造</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a>软件：演员的表演是高出剧本的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="713">11:53</a>太搞笑了，没有吻戏，我都已经上头成这样了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="883">14:43</a>如何攻略书粉：大IP改编的难点与机会</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>二、剧宣X观众：原来许愿是可以成真的，离开了永夜星河谁还把我当小孩</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a>慕声小剧场：丁禹兮保持住，你做什么都会成功的</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1162">19:22</a>直播、扫楼：微醺的姐姐、人机的姐夫，有他俩在妙声更好磕了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1316">21:56</a>永夜星河账号：官方账号的拟人化，为什么观众这么喜欢“活人感”</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1388">23:08</a>王一栩账号：制作人走向前台，怎么不是一种商业新模式呢</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1591">26:31</a>你好星期六：演员上综艺是正面效果还是负面效果</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1829">30:29</a>双人古风写真：夏弃疾老师，谁来了不说一句厨神</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1909">31:49</a>寄明月、拼豆、沙画：传播范围扩大，二次元们动了</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1953">32:33</a>团综：妻子的浪漫旅行，说错了是闪耀的恒星</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a>联动演员个人活动：商业价值的双赢</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>三、初礼X昼川：我的白月光CP复活了</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2178">36:18</a>“我被光所诱惑”：高敏感型人格需要一个赶不走的爱人</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2313">38:33</a>高冷腹黑X元气甜美：是一个爱情公式吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2413">40:13</a>磕CP的时候代入的是女演员还是男演员</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>四、虞书欣X丁禹兮：两个这么好的人，我们希望他们都被珍视热爱</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2653">44:13</a>虞书欣：“坚持做自己”，她说这句话我能信</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2781">46:21</a>丁禹兮：“谨言慎行”，付出型的含金量还在上升</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a>丁舟杰文学：虞书欣出国了100次，丁禹兮胆小了101次，你的青春也酸涩过吗</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3047">50:47</a>社会环境：恋综、离婚综，2024，我们向往纯爱</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3079">51:19</a>赶路粉：一种新的CP粉，清醒、理智、接受BE，但还是无法自制</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3449">57:29</a>石榴、海棠为什么没有打起来：粉丝成分构成</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3655">60:55</a>一些CP选择指南：综合考虑外形、年龄、性格、对方粉丝</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3742">62:22</a>CP营销的得与失：这对太火炒不了下对，CP粉如何转化</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3849">64:09</a>大胆开麦：未来IP改编，得女频文者得天下</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>P.s. 想要了解更多有关《永夜星河》的精彩故事内容，欢迎收听我们的上一期节目！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/674389f511045e78e5945381" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/674389f511045e78e5945381"><em><span>《永夜星河》精彩内容大盘点&amp;解析：它想讲的可能比你想看的要多得多</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>【夏弃疾老师：神厨】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FluhJJe5SYi0jgaa-jcqg-wcIpqB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【一张喜欢的二创】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-Lm2kfIXEziMJdByFoB1rGc4q5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【团综神图】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTPBl1EXL6eVRbAIcIR-0AUpoFk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【昼川的表白】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fvj731fG8bQLL0Q-khY4nqNqOtju.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【丁舟杰文学】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu3ckhFMhXC5YBowXKGe9T_xbxab.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnanSOF26kv8OgsLu2qmamUH9lQm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【赶路粉誓言】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgLa9fnk8nT5xjuMA7ysbNmvHdHV.png"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ltxSBOmrMCDa-CVvmSVHhsWFd55D.m4a" length="129349389" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:09:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsyh6JkgskKw5nLxIBSrvcFPG-1T.jpg"/>
