  <item>
    <title>《永夜星河》精彩内容大盘点&amp;解析：它想讲的可能比你想看的要多得多</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/674389f511045e78e5945381</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">674389f511045e78e5945381</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Nov 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《永夜星河》梗概：故事发生在2023年，知名玄幻志怪作家浮舟的新小说《捉妖》问世。他的资深书粉打工少女凌妙妙却在听完书之后对这部作品非常不满，主线单薄人物扁平，最后全员悲剧过于狗血，有失水准。结果自己居然阴差阳错地穿越到了这本不怎么友好的捉妖世界中，附身到了恶毒女二林虞的身上，并且需要完成系统指派的各种高难度任务才能顺利返回现实。在完成任务的过程中，妙妙和慕声、慕瑶、柳拂衣三位捉妖师缔结了深厚的情谊，逐渐爱上了这个人与妖共存的奇幻世界，并尝试改变浮舟笔下的惨烈结局。最后在妙妙、慕声和全书几乎所有角色的共同努力下，实现了虚构与现实的对话，完成了两位主角的相互救赎，让这个世界从原定的天劫设定中活了下来。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8">00:00:08</a></span></em><span> 开场白：我为什么临时决定讲这部剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 1 六大精彩群像片段</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">00:06:15</a></span></em><span>见义勇为错了吗：性格决定的很可能不只是你一个人的命运（现实篇+太仓郡篇）</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1093">00:18:13</a></span></em><span>群像的魅力：小人物也有高光时刻，谁都不是谁的绿叶（迷途谷篇）</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1657">00:27:37</a></span></em><span>接纳与偏见：建议大家都来学学慕瑶的自我反省（了然谷篇）</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2118">00:35:18</a></span></em><span>最正的三角形：“我不能给你爱，但我可以给你尊重。”（圣京爱情篇）</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2911">00:48:31</a></span></em><span>反派到底是怎么跑偏的：主播居然对赵太妃感同身受！？（圣京事业篇）</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3800">01:03:20</a></span></em><span>复活有何价值：我们的心魔原来是无法逾越的痛苦记忆（无忧水寨+六如村篇）</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>Part 2 妙妙与子期的好感度变化</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4325">01:12:05</a></span></em><span> -200%：虚情假意，别怪我心狠手辣</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4365">01:12:45</a></span></em><span> 0%：欢迎带着真情实感走进我的世界</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4448">01:14:08</a></span></em><span> -25%：我不是游戏输不起，我是怕你和我不熟</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4540">01:15:40</a></span></em><span> -29%：不要觉得这样我就能敞开心扉</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4635">01:17:15</a></span></em><span> 8.5%：那一刻，我看到了光</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4776">01:19:36</a></span></em><span> 20%：对不起，但我没有足够的勇气</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4810">01:20:10</a></span></em><span> 55%：我发誓，我不会丢下你一个人</span></li><span>  </span><li><em><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4933">01:22:13</a></span></em><span> 99%：如果你需要，我可以付出一切</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>【圣京爱情篇人物关系图--Part1第四节需要用到的PPT（纯自制）】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlKuVGStgCeHjxyo1h5NS-YJTUIU.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【与本期内容相关的名场面节选（一小部分而已，好看的太多了放不下了TwT）】</span></p><span></span><p><span>P1.1【只要你平平安安的，我就放心了】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqFE0PbMuzR2f6FKLZy7vpJFTUHp.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnA7TkORA1CQ_756sTox1Lw8_3OC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>P1.2【人有七窍，但妖只有一窍】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlZDIN6F6OcKiSlj1j1qX8Iqq1IV.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>P1.3【消除偏见，从我做起】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlxnEcDVXl1YUKRA3cWBmQohNfvw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【阿声，委屈你了】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj2ZxM7aTD_Ekt7SL0AQeDUZ9Bpm.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtLG94UHmnz6OU3OTiw4fHK0YNSF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>P1.4【你从未见过的“六折叠修罗场”】&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjJ97FB3iwrdCR5BA6ZdfdY3pok.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【请大家自行解读】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lj73tBUDlLYC25eNuZBHbM7Gt8Cm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>P1.5【我为什么说群像剧是神】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpnGBKLVyikPMmk45sqNku1RULRw.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>P1.6【“你会死的！”“死又如何！”】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk_NGWFtL9yp29NKNjuovrLtga6Y.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>P2</span></p><span></span><p><span>【-200%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo2ld__ZVa5WMszrUU-Kw1pOJF6L.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【0%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lr2sYii3Z_t6CslvgHOc7Qiu7Dj3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【-25%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjCYUXRay7eZyTPqJNaiku4-t08f.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>【8.5%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/luy-41xR0slWQDQApx68gVWYEBfV.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【20%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lnlubVuBYf4xLnZJJwpjeacDuDZ4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【55%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpG221juCFXUVDTx2RmihExu3vkD.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljv3yOZUttgu4bDJEKbGGI283iej.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【90%+（我猜的）】&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpglOQ7XcVVpZ-CtY9g_TBkQnPJf.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;【99%】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRspikNNEXSLdFDuBRBaSEOUSug.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>（仅供分享交流，侵删）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bgm：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《凝眸（对唱版伴奏）》——王心凌/张远</span></p><span></span><p><span>《重塑（伴奏）》——都智文</span></p><span></span><p><span>《破妖阵》——廖正星</span></p><span></span><p><span>《定情》——张博伦shigiYK</span></p><span></span><p><span>《寄沧海》、《怎么了犯法啊？》、《100%凌妙妙》、《“妙妙…”》、《他的发带》、《明月入怀》、《穿越时空的拥抱》——解男</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhFUWNY3hPgaxLTquAfkr1bqjm5P.m4a" length="176587913" type="audio/mp4"/>
