  <item>
    <title>《绝区零》剧情解读|EP.4 风波迭起，浴火重生，卡吕冬之子与您相约外环！(1.2主线)</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6720ab77cbe0e69c8b850653</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6720ab77cbe0e69c8b850653</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Oct 2024 09:40:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎收听《绝区零》系列！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（前排提醒：本期含有巨量剧情与人物分析！还有必不可少的伏笔与考据内容！是目前为止最详细的解读，走过路过不要错过！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期给各位带来的是1.0-1.2版本中第二至第四章的主线剧情下半集（暂时不包括间章及卧底蓝调）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>千呼万唤始出来，从开服起就一直备受瞩目的外环组织卡吕冬之子终于在1.2版本正式上线了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本期剧情中，绳匠兄妹法厄同将继续追查珀尔曼的线索，拓展全新的外环业务，与第四个高手如云的民间组织“卡吕冬之子”建立深厚的联系。</span></p><span></span><p><span>融合了美西拓荒文化与希腊内战元素的新剧情可谓是跌宕起伏，险象环生，让人直呼过瘾。</span></p><span></span><p><span>快来一起感受不一样的帮派斗争，细品机车族的铁血柔情吧！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">00:01:35</a> 外环&amp;卡吕冬之子介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="617">00:10:17</a> 急中生智的自救</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1315">00:21:55</a> 意想不到的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">00:25:23</a> 捷足先登的买手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1750">00:29:10</a> 背叛与否的终点</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2498">00:41:38</a> 英雄诞生的骑行</span></p><span></span><p><span>【热情的“欢迎仪式”】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpGg1RFWhtudMj-o3YqJN7bs6Pnq.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【卡吕冬之子】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/llWXssB6-yVKI8tRFdg4WTScKITJ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【火狱骑行开始】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkFn2BzsPQ-9KC56LyM1tSof987t.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【庞培以骸化（有点帅）】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiInLE9-_-KqFEE-AGOUutMzuIFB.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【绝望的终点】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FokS_mNmmB882vFnSOxM1GxVlAr8.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【凯撒牺牲】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr1qpMzAmivwtoeRBN7bMUlw80JM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【回“家”】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lknzTrvws7Xl_e9ASFTlXEp-mkfR.png"></figure>]]></description>
