  <item>
    <title>《崩坏：星穹铁道》剧情解读|EP.6 后发制敌，步步为营的猎狼行动（2.5主线）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670f74210d2f24f289896245</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670f74210d2f24f289896245</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 16 Oct 2024 08:06:57 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不好意思又让大家久等了！欢迎继续收听《崩坏：星穹铁道》的剧情解读！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目将书接上回，继续讲述发生在罗浮仙舟上的故事，游戏的2.5版本：“碧羽飞黄射天狼”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>步离人救出呼雷成功越狱，三位帝弓天将已做好准备对抗内忧外患，明处暗处的一切罪孽都将无所遁形。</span></p><span></span><p><span>身处险境、机敏勇敢的椒丘将如何自救，同时找到医治飞霄的方法？顶级心理博弈即将上演！</span></p><span></span><p><span>面对呼雷的阳谋，飞霄又将作何选择？</span></p><span></span><p><span>景元是否做到了激浊扬清？仙舟能否顺利度过难关？</span></p><span></span><p><span>听说故事的结尾又放出了重磅伏笔，莫非还有高手？</span></p><span></span><p><span>在本集中，科迪将重点为大家解读剧情中容易被忽略的</span><strong><span>各种隐藏信息</span></strong><span>，并以</span><strong><span>角色心理分析</span></strong><span>为主，力求为各位呈现一个细致、完整的精彩故事！</span></p><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="117">00:01:57</a> 烽举烟传，枕弧待战（飞霄、怀炎布置任务）</span></h1><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="356">00:05:56</a> 缕析条分，故事重问（景元等人调查幽囚狱）</span></h1><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="676">00:11:16</a> 刀俎横陈，掌中孤魂（椒丘与呼雷对峙）</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">00:19:34</a> 围三阙一，赤血传檄（飞霄调查迴星港，呼雷重组步离军）</span></p><span></span><h1><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">00:31:22</a> 敛魂血轮，率兽食人（呼雷制造恐慌，飞霄从容应对）</span></h1><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">00:35:36</a> 天击长驱，镇绥无虞 （飞霄清扫战场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2204">00:36:44</a> 解裂残躯，独狼负隅 （决战邀请）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2285">00:38:05</a> 挽澜扶危，舍我其谁 （虚假的仪典，真正的战场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2519">00:41:59</a> 岂曰无持，同气连枝 （后辈身处险境，椒丘以身入局）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2751">00:45:51</a> 霜刃飞光，天狐迷狂 （呼雷殊死一搏）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2948">00:49:08</a> 欃枪烈烈，心兽灭却（心兽的战场，最终决战）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3532">00:58:52</a> 射浪偃潮，旧恨云消 （灵砂、丹恒铲除毒瘤）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3949">01:05:49</a> 玉阙黄钟，天外归鸿 （善后之事，伏笔来袭）</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmRcr1H6BAhVMZPdltFwtE8M6QT2.m4a" length="69403551" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:11:31</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fsyh6JkgskKw5nLxIBSrvcFPG-1T.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>《绝区零》剧情解读|EP.3 白祇重工热血狂飙，维多利亚优雅营救（主线第二、三章）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6702513181cdab3a9309f795</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6702513181cdab3a9309f795</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 06 Oct 2024 08:58:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，欢迎收听久违的《绝区零》系列！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期给各位带来的是1.0-1.2版本中第二至第四章的主线剧情上半集（暂时不包括间章及卧底蓝调）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>在今天的节目里，科迪将为大家重点梳理与新登场的白祇重工（第二章：在空洞的中心呼唤…？）以及维多利亚家政（第三章：危楼夜寻踪）相关的主要内容及大量伏笔。</span></p><span></span><p><span>作为第一章（猫的失物）的延续，后面的故事为我们不断扩充了世界观，一个个小阴谋背后的大阴谋也逐渐浮出水面，吊足了玩家的胃口。</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望本期节目能够给大家带来不错的体验，对后续剧情感兴趣的朋友可以点个关注不迷路！</span></p><span></span><p><span>下半集我们将继续讲述1.2版本在新地区发生的新故事——“火狱骑行”（周中不定时上线）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【第二章：在空洞的中心呼唤…？】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="97">00:01:37</a> 指名委托（白祇重工登场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="514">00:08:34</a> 兄弟！要出发了！（抓物机汉斯）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="622">00:10:22</a> 机形的爱（掘进机格莱特）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="772">00:12:52</a> 疾速追机（打桩机星期五+白祇秘辛）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">00:18:23</a> 追本溯源（原型机+新型怪物）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1597">00:26:37</a> 善后工作（伏笔）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【第三章：危楼夜寻踪】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1923">00:32:03</a> 诡异的来信（维多利亚登场）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2346">00:39:06</a> 舞步上行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">00:40:43</a> 黑暗中的足迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2657">00:44:17</a> 拯救大黑客芮恩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3028">00:50:28</a> 善后工作（大量伏笔+新的危机）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【白祇重工】我们的目标不是建房子，而是家（左至右：大本、珂蕾妲、安东、格莉丝）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fls3xRJdlUby3c1tUNKH0PCrK5Jo.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【维多利亚家政】感谢指名维多利亚家政，主人的心愿就是我们的使命（左至右：丽娜、莱卡恩、可琳、艾莲）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft7wAGZP82zw2kyAvkHG_E6702Nv.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【男子汉的觉悟】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fv3pMkJDFPNy9tLryAV_RZ_gnNqu.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【劝解热恋少女】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtL1WDLx6BkkUGUoJWqS_T1SJGzL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【牲鬼初见】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlLq7auuQ7a47pMBbVjIAsgc_Nn4.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【挖掘机大战】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FilwXU6dZ-wiTQHM3yEz7hxCK8g-.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【维多利亚家政登场】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmQxc1Q5Ks_7jH63NYddKljL5RrK.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【宁芙双子登场】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMGp1VSvbyMa5C0LmiyDqq7RemZ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【月下狼人】</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoGUEmlsK4GBEfu77jHr_rMrGL1W.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【原型机、再启动：官方视频链接（四国配音）】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ay411i7FQ/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click" href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ay411i7FQ/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click">www.bilibili.com</a></span></p>]]></description>
